# ==============================================================================
# 42 JAVA POOL - STANDARD .GITIGNORE
# Designed to enforce the rule: "You should not leave in your directory any other
# file than those explicitly specified by the exercise instructions." [2]
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Java Compiler Output (Strictly Forbidden to Turn In!)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compiled class files must NEVER be pushed to your repository.
*.class

# Package files
*.war
*.sar
*.ear
*.jar

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. IntelliJ IDEA Configs (Generated by multi-module/workspace setups)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Since you'll be configuring Multi-Module Workspaces, IntelliJ will
# generate local configuration files in each exercise folder. Pushing these will
# fail your peer evaluations because they are "extra files" [2].
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
out/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. VS Code Configurations (If you or your peers open files in VS Code)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. OS-specific Metadata (Notorious 42 Evaluation Killers!)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS metadata files (like .DS_Store) are automatically created when browsing
# directories via Finder and will result in a "failure due to extra files" [2].
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon_
._*

# Windows-specific metadata
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Linux-specific metadata
.directory

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Temporary & Log Files
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
en.md